              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 16.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore anaa enayieuni te nkisiayiare e pooki olong'i, neitayuni ilasarri terisioroto enkitanapata e Musa too sabatoni, o too lapaitin ng'ejuko okuni to lari o sirua loo mukateni neitu eisuijieki, o sirua loo wikii, o sirua loo lng'oborri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te risioroto e nkikoo e Daudi papaai lenye, etegelua ninye ilturrurri loo lapolosak tenkaraki enkisiaayiare enye, o Lawi tenkaraki isiaaitin enye e nkisisa o enkisiaayiare te dukuya ilapolosak metaasa esiaai te pooki olong nayieuni; o ilarripok loo nchomito loo lturrurri lenye too nchomito esiana naje; amu ina apa eitanapishe Daudi osinka le Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitu ninche eibelekenya apaash ina naitanapa olaiguanani ilapolosak o Lawi tialo pooki bae o too lchumat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
